{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42736","headline":"巫庙 · 王周","name":"巫庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巴水走若箭，峡山开如屏。\n汹涌匹练白，𡷾崒浓蓝青\n崖空蓄云雨，滩恶惊雷霆。\n神仙宅幽邃，庙貌横杳冥。\n隐约可一梦，缥缈余千龄。\n名利有所役，舟楫无暂停。\n悉宰垂[肸]蠁，祠祷希安宁。\n鵶鵶尔何物，飞飞来庙庭。\n纷纷扬寥泬，远近随虚舲。\n铁石砺觜爪，金碧辉光翎。\n翔集托阴险，鵮啄贪羶腥。\n日既恃威福，岁久爲精灵。\n依草与附木，诬诡殊不经。\n城狐与社鼠，琐细何足听。\n况乎人假人，心阔吞沧溟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王周","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42736.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42736","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}